  displayName: Past the Ridge
  description: 'The trees round the Haven don''t grow back as fast as they are cut. Tor knows old cuttings past where the portal takes you: send people out on a foray from the Haven''s Lands ({key:Haven}). They go on their own and come home with what they find, but their work waits while they are gone.'
  chain: Tor
  journalNotes: A foray costs hands at home. Send those whose work can wait, and friends together.
